  "description": null,
  "mentions": [
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "entryId": "chuci-01-03",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "\n\n虽不周于今之人兮，\n\n愿依彭咸之遗则！"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "entryId": "chuci-01-13",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "\n既莫足与为美政兮，\n\n吾将从彭咸之所居！"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "entryId": "chuci-04-05",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "光。\n\n望三五以为像兮,\n\n指彭咸以为仪。\n\n夫何极而不至兮,\n"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "entryId": "chuci-04-08",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "也。\n\n独茕茕而南行兮,\n\n思彭咸之故也。"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "entryId": "chuci-04-11",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "兮,\n\n声有隐而先倡。\n\n夫何彭咸之造思兮,\n\n暨志介而不忘。\n"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "entryId": "chuci-04-12",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "娱。\n\n凌大波而流风兮,\n\n托彭咸之所居。\n\n上高岩之峭岸兮,\n"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 11,
      "entryId": "chuci-11-07",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "匿兮,\n\n谗谀登乎明堂。\n\n弃彭咸之娱乐兮,\n\n灭巧倕之绳墨。\n"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 13,
      "entryId": "chuci-13-02",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "。\n\n九年之中不吾反兮,\n\n思彭咸之水游。\n\n惜师延之浮渚兮,\n"
    }
  ],
  "firstSeen": {
